WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:38.970
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.240 --> 01:41.240
[Episode 12]

3
01:42.560 --> 01:43.813
Come on.

4
01:56.379 --> 01:57.680
Chang Xuan!

5
01:57.680 --> 01:59.006
Corps Commander!

6
02:10.520 --> 02:12.825
It's all about money, isn't it?

7
02:12.825 --> 02:15.099
You should've said so. I'll pay you.

8
02:17.900 --> 02:19.979
Stay back! Don't come any closer!

9
02:19.979 --> 02:21.780
I'll kill her if you come any closer!

10
02:21.780 --> 02:24.039
Get back! Or I'll kill her!

11
02:24.039 --> 02:26.640
And that money... it was meant to be our pay!

12
02:26.640 --> 02:31.480
I earned it! I risked my life for it!

13
02:31.480 --> 02:35.560
You people, all dressed up in gold and silk,

14
02:35.560 --> 02:39.979
got rich off our blood, off our sacrifices!

15
02:39.979 --> 02:44.879
You never once treated us as human beings!

16
02:45.760 --> 02:50.860
If I'm going down, this woman is coming with me!

17
02:52.180 --> 02:53.473
- No! - Corps Commander!

18
02:56.180 --> 02:58.139
- Chang Xuan! - Yu Chang Xuan!

19
03:06.520 --> 03:08.169
Who the hell told you to shoot?

20
03:08.169 --> 03:09.539
Get him treated!

21
03:09.539 --> 03:10.966
Hurry!

22
03:12.555 --> 03:14.560
Where's the medic? Get the medic!

23
03:14.560 --> 03:16.600
Get a medic, now!

24
03:16.600 --> 03:18.932
- Corps Commander! - Corps Commander!

25
03:18.932 --> 03:20.440
- Chang Xuan! - Chang Xuan!

26
03:20.440 --> 03:21.600
Chang...

27
03:22.280 --> 03:23.739
Are you hurt?

28
03:27.879 --> 03:29.099
You got injured.

29
03:30.400 --> 03:31.700
It's nothing.

30
04:29.520 --> 04:30.913
Master Chang Xuan.

31
04:31.640 --> 04:33.760
Thank you for your help.

32
04:39.520 --> 04:41.801
How is your wound? Are you all right?

33
04:49.600 --> 04:51.039
Worried about me?

34
05:05.720 --> 05:08.220
It was so dangerous today.

35
05:09.699 --> 05:11.600
Why did you save me?

36
05:12.259 --> 05:17.100
What do you think made me do something so foolish?

37
05:25.420 --> 05:29.839
Honestly, don't you know that?

38
05:45.699 --> 05:46.860
Sorry, I've got plans.

39
05:46.860 --> 05:47.980
I should get going.

40
05:47.980 --> 05:49.219
Ye Ping Jun.

41
05:50.680 --> 05:54.481
You can't refuse what I'm offering.

42
05:56.560 --> 05:58.380
So why bother?

43
06:57.600 --> 07:01.980
What do you think made me do something so foolish?

44
07:11.680 --> 07:12.926
Ping Jun.

45
07:15.040 --> 07:18.346
- Xue Ting. - Ping Jun, are you alright? Are you hurt?

46
07:19.440 --> 07:22.379
I'm fine. I'm perfectly fine.

47
07:25.600 --> 07:29.040
I heard about what happened today.

48
07:30.080 --> 07:31.180
Ping Jun.

49
07:31.920 --> 07:33.286
We need to talk.

50
07:35.879 --> 07:37.120
Ping Jun.

51
07:38.200 --> 07:42.320
I'm sure you've felt by now how Yu Chang Xuan feels about you.

52
07:49.560 --> 07:51.440
Xue Ting,

53
07:51.440 --> 07:55.466
I have something to tell you.

54
07:58.000 --> 08:03.370
I had no choice but to pretend to be a couple with Yu Chang Xuan to make Miss Zi Yi jealous.

55
08:03.370 --> 08:06.080
There was a lot of gossip around at the time.

56
08:10.880 --> 08:14.240
I didn't tell you because I was afraid you'd misunderstand.

57
08:14.240 --> 08:15.605
Please believe me.

58
08:15.605 --> 08:18.500
There was nothing between him and me but using each other.

59
08:19.600 --> 08:21.680
Maybe you were using each other before,

60
08:21.680 --> 08:26.360
but now you're on his mind.

61
08:26.360 --> 08:28.160
I was just as shocked by what happened today.

62
08:28.160 --> 08:30.480
- I really didn't know... - Ping Jun.

63
08:34.920 --> 08:36.386
Let's get married.

64
08:47.520 --> 08:51.077
- Xue Ting-- - I was going to propose after you graduated.

65
08:51.077 --> 08:52.966
But I can't wait any more.

66
08:52.966 --> 08:56.013
I want us to have the wedding once you graduate.

67
09:02.160 --> 09:05.517
Ping Jun, in sickness and in health,

68
09:05.517 --> 09:07.741
I, Jiang Xue Ting, will never let you down,

69
09:07.741 --> 09:10.053
and I'll never forget your mom's kindness.

70
09:37.960 --> 09:39.279
Ping Jun.

71
10:05.280 --> 10:07.126
Master Chang Xuan is back.

72
10:09.480 --> 10:11.760
Mother, still up this late?

73
10:11.760 --> 10:15.080
How could I sleep after everything that happened today?

74
10:18.680 --> 10:21.133
I'm fine. Don't worry about me.

75
10:21.133 --> 10:23.804
Chang Xuan, how is your wound?

76
10:23.804 --> 10:25.920
Got two stitches. It's almost healed.

77
10:25.920 --> 10:27.151
Don't worry.

78
10:30.800 --> 10:33.440
Tell me the truth.

79
10:33.440 --> 10:34.720
That Miss Ye--

80
10:34.720 --> 10:38.560
Mother, the Yu Army's reputation is at stake.

81
10:38.560 --> 10:42.737
If that soldier in the hospital killed someone over their embezzled pay,

82
10:42.737 --> 10:44.706
things won't end well.

83
10:44.706 --> 10:48.547
No matter who it was today, I had to save them.

84
10:48.547 --> 10:52.250
No matter what, you are engaged to Zi Yi.

85
10:52.250 --> 10:55.273
If the engagement falls through, we'll be a laughingstock.

86
10:56.200 --> 10:59.320
Mother, that's impossible.

87
10:59.320 --> 11:01.600
The engagement won't fall through.

88
11:01.600 --> 11:04.740
Miss Ye probably doesn't think much of me.

89
11:09.040 --> 11:12.163
Mother, whatever it is, let's talk tomorrow.

90
11:12.163 --> 11:13.904
Let Chang Xuan get some rest.

91
11:14.880 --> 11:17.080
Get your head straight.

92
11:17.080 --> 11:19.040
Let's go.

93
11:19.040 --> 11:20.337
Rest early.

94
11:20.337 --> 11:22.140
You too.

95
11:48.560 --> 11:50.440
Was I out of control today?

96
11:51.080 --> 11:54.979
You risked your life to save her for the Yu Army's reputation.

97
11:55.720 --> 11:56.720
No.

98
11:57.680 --> 11:59.560
I did lose control today.

99
12:02.520 --> 12:04.573
Over Ye Ping Jun.

100
12:12.240 --> 12:14.639
When did it start?

101
12:17.720 --> 12:22.661
Maybe it was the first time we met, she had the guts to bet with me.

102
12:25.080 --> 12:26.533
Maybe...

103
12:28.800 --> 12:31.881
it was that night she went with me to see Yang Shi Ying.

104
12:33.800 --> 12:35.300
Or maybe,

105
12:36.600 --> 12:39.901
it was when she argued with me for those refugees

106
12:40.680 --> 12:43.060
she didn't even know.

107
12:54.980 --> 12:56.360
But you said it yourself

108
12:57.680 --> 13:02.659
that getting lost in love makes one lose control and reason.

109
13:02.659 --> 13:04.385
People stop being themselves.

110
13:05.080 --> 13:07.933
Smart people become fools.

111
13:07.933 --> 13:12.226
Schemers end up sacrificing their own interests and still can't break free.

112
13:14.360 --> 13:16.059
I also told myself

113
13:17.073 --> 13:22.173
it was just a passing fling I'd forget.

114
13:24.080 --> 13:26.221
But Ye Ping Jun...

115
13:26.866 --> 13:29.313
She's lingering in my mind.

116
13:33.640 --> 13:36.240
I can't get any peace.

117
13:37.559 --> 13:38.720
Chang Xuan,

118
13:40.159 --> 13:41.759
Miss Zi Yi...

119
13:47.960 --> 13:49.273
Rui Tong.

120
13:53.200 --> 13:56.260
I want to keep the girl I like by my side.

121
13:57.360 --> 13:58.959
Is it that hard?

122
14:15.160 --> 14:17.124
Chang Xuan, he's finally awake.

123
14:17.124 --> 14:18.240
Clear-headed.

124
14:18.240 --> 14:19.653
We can question him now.

125
14:23.620 --> 14:24.840
How could this happen?

126
14:24.840 --> 14:26.399
We don't know either.

127
14:38.280 --> 14:41.679
Master Chang Xuan, someone slipped into his ward and switched his infusion bottle.

128
14:41.679 --> 14:43.200
The fluid he's on is highly toxic.

129
14:43.200 --> 14:46.306
We did everything we could, but he didn't make it.

130
14:51.880 --> 14:57.340
Chang Xuan, why would anyone assassinate an ordinary soldier like him?

131
15:02.519 --> 15:04.933
Did you get a look at the one who did it?

132
15:09.960 --> 15:14.180
If you have any last wishes, I'll fulfill them.

133
15:15.440 --> 15:19.840
I went to the hospital director for an explanation,

134
15:19.840 --> 15:25.320
and I overheard them saying the embezzled military pay from this hospital

135
15:25.320 --> 15:29.700
is hidden in a medicine warehouse

136
15:30.419 --> 15:33.360
on the city outskirts.

137
15:34.080 --> 15:38.010
They said silver dollars were nothing.

138
15:38.010 --> 15:42.186
That place has...

139
15:43.200 --> 15:45.860
the real treasure.

140
16:25.600 --> 16:32.080
That place has the real treasure.

141
16:33.000 --> 16:35.004
You say I embezzled the gold mine.

142
16:35.004 --> 16:36.899
But you catch a thief with the goods.

143
16:36.899 --> 16:38.300
Where are they?

144
16:38.879 --> 16:40.553
Do you have the stolen goods?

145
16:41.919 --> 16:44.080
The real treasure.

146
16:45.280 --> 16:49.820
Rui Tong. Go to the medicine warehouse on the city outskirts.

147
17:01.640 --> 17:03.426
Search carefully.

148
17:07.600 --> 17:09.199
Handle with care.

149
17:28.360 --> 17:30.306
Chang Xuan, it's right here.

150
17:39.299 --> 17:41.660
All utensils are for melting gold.

151
17:41.660 --> 17:43.720
This must be where the gold was hidden.

152
17:43.720 --> 17:45.760
But the gold has already been moved.

153
17:45.760 --> 17:48.200
Feng San Li and his nephew are both under arrest.

154
17:48.200 --> 17:51.837
We've questioned every one of their men, and they're all too scared to make a move.

155
17:51.837 --> 17:54.786
So, who could have secretly moved the gold?

156
17:56.320 --> 18:01.340
Obviously, it's someone willing to protect Feng San Li at any cost.

157
18:10.572 --> 18:11.639
Father.

158
18:12.240 --> 18:14.400
I need to talk to you.

159
18:14.400 --> 18:15.660
Come in.

160
18:23.960 --> 18:26.040
What is it?

161
18:28.920 --> 18:33.920
All these years, only two things in your study have never changed.

162
18:35.320 --> 18:38.266
The white jade Guanyin statue where you burn incense for my brother.

163
18:38.960 --> 18:43.920
And the bullet Uncle Feng took

164
18:43.920 --> 18:46.241
when he shielded you back then.

165
18:47.000 --> 18:48.920
It hit him in the head,

166
18:49.520 --> 18:51.881
putting him into a coma for two months.

167
18:53.400 --> 18:59.200
He and I fought side by side through blood and fire.

168
18:59.200 --> 19:01.120
We saved each other's lives.

169
19:02.160 --> 19:04.266
I can't just forget that.

170
19:06.720 --> 19:08.350
So,

171
19:08.350 --> 19:10.345
because you can't let go of that old bond,

172
19:11.480 --> 19:14.889
even with the Yu Army standing on the brink,

173
19:14.889 --> 19:17.973
you're still covering up his crimes?

174
19:23.680 --> 19:25.306
So you found out.

175
19:29.880 --> 19:31.480
For as long as I can remember,

176
19:32.405 --> 19:34.360
you've always been fair with your men.

177
19:34.360 --> 19:36.853
You reward the ones who earn it,

178
19:37.520 --> 19:39.753
and punish the ones who don't. No favorites.

179
19:39.753 --> 19:41.026
But this time,

180
19:41.640 --> 19:45.924
you pushed Uncle Feng's nephew out to take the fall.

181
19:45.924 --> 19:50.559
And then you helped him move the stolen gold and cover up his crimes.

182
19:50.559 --> 19:54.466
You think he'll get off scot-free?

183
19:55.520 --> 19:59.646
That the central government will just let it go?

184
20:07.920 --> 20:09.880
I don't believe you don't know

185
20:09.880 --> 20:13.680
that if the Yu Army is caught hiding gold, they suspect us of ulterior motives.

186
20:13.680 --> 20:16.560
Isn't that exactly what the central government fears most?

187
20:16.560 --> 20:21.833
Do you want the Army Inspector sitting right in front of you holding you accountable?

188
20:21.833 --> 20:23.415
No one is perfect.

189
20:23.415 --> 20:25.820
Your Uncle Feng has his flaws,

190
20:26.440 --> 20:30.800
but he is brave and has achieved great military feats.

191
20:30.800 --> 20:33.240
I owe him my life.

192
20:33.240 --> 20:34.520
I should repay it.

193
20:34.520 --> 20:36.040
Do I still call him uncle?

194
20:37.960 --> 20:41.177
Feng San Li has been breaking the law,

195
20:41.177 --> 20:45.252
engaging in corruption, and trampling on human lives for years.

196
20:45.252 --> 20:47.933
Are these crimes all capital offenses?

197
20:49.120 --> 20:51.526
Haven't you done enough for him?

198
20:52.640 --> 20:56.899
You paid your debt to him long ago.

199
20:57.680 --> 20:59.160
But what about him?

200
20:59.160 --> 21:03.300
He used your loyalty to him as a shield to line his pockets,

201
21:03.300 --> 21:05.300
doing whatever he pleased.

202
21:05.300 --> 21:07.080
He is completely out of control.

203
21:07.080 --> 21:08.406
Now,

204
21:10.320 --> 21:14.520
the only way to warn others is to bring him to justice.

205
21:14.520 --> 21:20.097
Otherwise, cleaning up the Yu Army is nothing but empty words.

206
21:20.097 --> 21:24.040
People will see us as a scattered mess,

207
21:24.040 --> 21:26.110
a mere rabble,

208
21:26.110 --> 21:28.319
an army with no honor.

209
21:41.440 --> 21:46.046
Is there no other way for your Uncle Feng?

210
21:51.560 --> 21:54.326
If a military bandit who abuses power

211
21:54.326 --> 21:59.145
and treats human life like dirt can be pardoned,

212
22:04.360 --> 22:07.120
who will ever trust the Yu Army?

213
22:08.080 --> 22:11.060
We'd lose every soldier's trust.

214
22:11.060 --> 22:13.590
Morale will collapse completely.

215
22:13.590 --> 22:15.630
Set the precedent

216
22:16.480 --> 22:19.740
and the central government and every warlord, big and small,

217
22:20.680 --> 22:25.060
will come at us like wolves smelling flesh.

218
22:28.160 --> 22:34.101
The Yu Army will be waiting to be devoured.

219
23:12.859 --> 23:14.359
Uncle Feng,

220
23:22.600 --> 23:24.573
my father asked me to give you this.

221
24:05.880 --> 24:07.080
Father.

222
24:07.080 --> 24:08.983
Brigade Commander Feng has confessed.

223
24:08.983 --> 24:11.980
He is now on the train to Beijing.

224
24:15.520 --> 24:16.780
I see.

225
24:19.680 --> 24:21.886
You won't blame Chang Xuan, will you?

226
24:22.720 --> 24:28.619
Bing Wen, this is the first time I've felt old.

227
24:28.619 --> 24:30.773
It's time for me to step back.

228
24:33.360 --> 24:37.160
Only someone as impartial as Chang Xuan

229
24:37.160 --> 24:40.319
can thoroughly reform the Yu Army

230
24:40.319 --> 24:43.653
and clean out those corrupt, useless old relics.

231
24:44.560 --> 24:47.720
He can make it because you support him

232
24:47.720 --> 24:50.960
and will clear the way for him.

233
24:50.960 --> 24:56.300
I was too soft-hearted regarding Feng San Li.

234
24:58.120 --> 25:03.240
Now I believe Chang Xuan has the vision and the ability

235
25:03.240 --> 25:06.406
to give the Yu Army a fresh start.

236
25:06.406 --> 25:09.893
Your trust is the best support for Chang Xuan.

237
25:13.360 --> 25:17.913
Bing Wen, you and Chang Xuan have always been close.

238
25:18.600 --> 25:20.946
With your assistance in military affairs,

239
25:21.880 --> 25:25.166
I'm confident in letting Chang Xuan take over the army.

240
25:27.040 --> 25:28.643
I am an orphan.

241
25:28.643 --> 25:30.059
I have no parents.

242
25:30.720 --> 25:32.944
You didn't mind my background,

243
25:32.944 --> 25:34.480
brought me into the Yu family,

244
25:34.480 --> 25:36.117
and even married Jin Xuan to me.

245
25:36.117 --> 25:41.519
I can never repay that kindness in this lifetime.

246
25:45.000 --> 25:48.006
Do you know what I value most in you?

247
25:51.040 --> 25:54.760
You never meddle in politics, never chase fame or profit,

248
25:54.760 --> 25:56.600
and you know gratitude.

249
25:56.600 --> 26:00.580
Like a bullet in the chamber.

250
26:01.480 --> 26:05.399
Then the trigger will always be pulled by you.

251
26:16.480 --> 26:18.320
That performer's skills are really good.

252
26:18.320 --> 26:19.730
Yes.

253
26:19.730 --> 26:21.233
- Lan Qing. - Lan Qing.

254
26:22.000 --> 26:24.593
Master Chang Xuan hasn't been around here in a while, has he?

255
26:24.593 --> 26:26.120
Have you heard?

256
26:26.120 --> 26:28.760
He took a blade for Ye Ping Jun.

257
26:28.760 --> 26:31.837
A man like that, so high and mighty, bleeding for her.

258
26:31.837 --> 26:35.920
I never noticed Master Chang Xuan had those kinds of feelings for Ye Ping Jun.

259
26:35.920 --> 26:37.717
That's because you're blind.

260
26:37.717 --> 26:39.280
I saw it ages ago.

261
26:39.280 --> 26:41.084
That girl is quite something.

262
26:41.084 --> 26:44.799
A few tricks and she had Master Chang Xuan wrapped around her finger.

263
26:45.360 --> 26:49.417
Not like a certain someone, wasted years waiting,

264
26:49.417 --> 26:53.800
only to end up as a little plaything to keep others amused.

265
26:58.720 --> 27:06.326
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

266
27:10.560 --> 27:18.626
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

267
27:19.440 --> 27:30.266
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

268
27:31.440 --> 27:38.380
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

269
27:42.560 --> 27:48.206
♪ Spring is as green ♪

270
27:48.877 --> 27:56.740
♪ In vain she's lean ♪

271
27:57.640 --> 28:03.196
♪ Her kerchief soaked with tears ♪

272
28:03.196 --> 28:12.993
♪ And red with stains unclean ♪

273
28:16.440 --> 28:19.420
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

274
29:04.680 --> 29:09.793
[Respectfully submitted by Jiang Xue Ting]

275
29:11.000 --> 29:14.226
[Writer: Jun Guan]

276
29:18.520 --> 29:19.653
Rui Tong.

277
29:20.720 --> 29:22.540
Come to my office.

278
29:27.319 --> 29:30.880
How come the last stroke on both characters "evil" flicks outward?

279
29:32.080 --> 29:34.280
Because the same person wrote them.

280
29:36.240 --> 29:38.320
[Respectfully submitted by Jiang Xue Ting]

281
29:39.840 --> 29:42.240
- Should we arrest him right away? - No.

282
29:42.240 --> 29:43.526
Not yet.

283
29:45.240 --> 29:50.960
I want to see who's behind Jiang Xue Ting.

284
29:56.655 --> 29:57.680
[Meditation Hall]

285
29:57.680 --> 30:02.486
Master Chang Xuan, the lamp-lighting and offering ceremony will begin tonight.

286
30:02.486 --> 30:05.699
Will the offerings be the same as in previous years?

287
30:06.333 --> 30:09.552
This year, I'd like to have a layer of gold applied to each Bodhisattva statue.

288
30:10.126 --> 30:13.920
Thank you for your patronage of our temple all these years.

289
30:14.599 --> 30:18.404
You've been holding the deliverance rites for my brother.

290
30:18.404 --> 30:21.059
His memorial tablet is also enshrined in your temple.

291
30:21.720 --> 30:23.280
So, thank you, Abbot,

292
30:23.280 --> 30:25.953
for making sure his tablet swept and cleaned regularly.

293
30:27.480 --> 30:30.570
Master Ming Xuan has long since entered the Pure Land.

294
30:30.570 --> 30:32.920
He will surely watch over the Yu family,

295
30:32.920 --> 30:36.166
turning misfortune into fortune and bringing blessings at all hours.

296
30:37.240 --> 30:40.710
The Bodhisattva sees all beings as equal.

297
30:40.710 --> 30:42.120
This is a sacred Buddhist place.

298
30:42.120 --> 30:44.406
I wouldn't presume to be treated as an exception.

299
32:00.080 --> 32:01.926
Here to pray for your father?

300
32:04.440 --> 32:05.539
Yes.

301
32:06.560 --> 32:07.800
And you?

302
32:08.920 --> 32:10.326
For my elder brother.

303
32:15.880 --> 32:17.679
How is your injury?

304
32:18.640 --> 32:22.000
Thanks to you, Miss Ye, it's nothing serious now.

305
32:25.400 --> 32:30.300
I heard they've finished investigating

306
32:31.059 --> 32:34.460
the soldier who attacked us?

307
32:36.200 --> 32:41.497
The one who embezzled soldiers' pay was an old subordinate of my father's.

308
32:41.497 --> 32:44.040
They fought side by side for over 20 years.

309
32:46.480 --> 32:49.780
I never thought people could be this heartless.

310
32:51.000 --> 32:53.101
Trust and loyalty, however much there is,

311
32:53.779 --> 32:59.200
amount to nothing but thin paper when it comes to profit.

312
33:09.360 --> 33:14.133
The world can be cold, but you're different.

313
33:14.760 --> 33:16.381
You hold power,

314
33:17.600 --> 33:20.400
but you haven't let it cloud your conscience.

315
33:23.680 --> 33:25.086
Does that mean,

316
33:25.819 --> 33:27.220
in your eyes,

317
33:28.099 --> 33:29.773
I'm a good man?

318
33:32.840 --> 33:34.946
You protect this land.

319
33:35.779 --> 33:42.180
So I'll pray that the Yu Army can bring the people true peace.

320
33:42.840 --> 33:47.906
That means far more than whether I think you're a good man.

321
33:49.680 --> 33:53.380
I'll take your words to heart.

322
33:57.279 --> 34:01.099
Maybe if we'd met at a different time,

323
34:02.240 --> 34:04.381
or in a different place,

324
34:05.200 --> 34:07.206
we could have gotten along peacefully.

325
34:08.960 --> 34:10.200
What?

326
34:10.200 --> 34:12.573
Couldn't we get along well?

327
34:14.960 --> 34:17.486
At most, not so hostile toward each other.

328
34:19.640 --> 34:21.106
Master Chang Xuan,

329
34:21.880 --> 34:24.100
I'm grateful you saved me,

330
34:25.160 --> 34:29.846
but your presence has completely disrupted the life I had.

331
34:31.240 --> 34:35.466
You and I are worlds apart.

332
34:36.280 --> 34:41.266
Being able to talk like this is already more than I could ask for.

333
34:55.720 --> 34:58.100
I had just begun to warm,

334
34:59.200 --> 35:04.606
and now your words have plunged me back into an icy pit.

335
35:07.360 --> 35:10.966
I sincerely wish you all the best in the future.

336
35:12.520 --> 35:14.433
But from now on,

337
35:17.560 --> 35:20.201
let's not have any more contact.

338
36:11.280 --> 36:12.673
Too late.

339
36:15.780 --> 36:17.293
What did you say?

340
36:18.520 --> 36:19.753
Nothing.

341
36:20.800 --> 36:23.360
I've just made a wish to the gods

342
36:23.360 --> 36:25.760
that we'd be good friends for life.

343
36:33.840 --> 36:35.773
Focus when you pray.

344
36:36.920 --> 36:40.413
I'm very devout.

345
38:17.472 --> 38:20.000
Back in Tokyo, Jiang Xue Ting had close ties with Shang Hong Wen,

346
38:20.000 --> 38:21.490
editor-in-chief of Nanhuai Press.

347
38:21.490 --> 38:23.920
Under the banner of standing up to warlords,

348
38:23.920 --> 38:26.800
Shang Hong Wen recruited a bunch of young idealists to work for him.

349
38:26.800 --> 38:29.617
But in fact, he's secretly working for local warlords,

350
38:29.617 --> 38:31.800
writing articles to go after their political rivals.

351
38:31.800 --> 38:32.920
All for profit.

352
38:32.920 --> 38:35.933
Where's Shang Hong Wen now?

353
38:36.680 --> 38:39.680
By the time I went to arrest him, he was already gone.

354
38:39.680 --> 38:40.783
But don't worry.

355
38:40.783 --> 38:43.800
I've ordered all land and water routes in Nanhuai to be locked down.

356
38:43.800 --> 38:45.120
Good.

357
38:45.120 --> 38:47.080
We can't let him get away.

358
38:47.080 --> 38:48.153
Yes, sir.

359
38:52.920 --> 38:55.840
A talent like you has always been admired.

360
38:55.840 --> 38:59.470
And now you're going to marry a beautiful bride. We're all jealous.

361
38:59.470 --> 39:02.800
If it weren't for your wedding, I wouldn't have accepted your resignation.

362
39:02.800 --> 39:05.564
Thank you all for looking after me these past months.

363
39:05.564 --> 39:08.599
Once Ping Jun graduates, we'll hold the wedding.

364
39:08.599 --> 39:11.560
I'll send everyone an invitation and treat you all to a good drink.

365
39:11.560 --> 39:13.400
- We'll be there for sure. - Congratulations!

366
39:13.400 --> 39:16.440
- May you two find your happy ending. - Thank you.

367
39:16.440 --> 39:18.266
A lifetime of happiness to you.

368
39:52.440 --> 39:54.086
Bring me more wine.

369
39:54.920 --> 39:56.546
Bring all of it.

370
40:10.040 --> 40:14.080
Master Chang Xuan, you've had enough.

371
40:15.539 --> 40:18.079
I said I want wine!

372
40:18.079 --> 40:19.260
Wine!

373
40:25.880 --> 40:27.800
Go and get Miss Lan Qing.

374
40:27.800 --> 40:29.113
Yes, sir.

375
40:54.219 --> 40:55.726
Where's my wine?

376
40:56.600 --> 40:57.750
You're drunk.

377
40:57.750 --> 40:59.200
More will only make it worse.

378
40:59.200 --> 41:01.680
Give me the wine.

379
41:01.680 --> 41:04.463
I made you some pear soup. Drink it and sober up.

380
41:04.463 --> 41:06.446
Leave me alone.

381
41:10.560 --> 41:12.421
I've never seen you like this.

382
41:13.179 --> 41:15.140
What happened on earth?

383
41:16.240 --> 41:19.420
How could I let you marry someone else?

384
41:22.120 --> 41:25.560
I will never let you marry anyone else.

385
41:27.039 --> 41:28.719
Ye Ping Jun.

386
41:31.079 --> 41:33.599
Ye Ping Jun.

387
41:37.380 --> 41:40.800
Ye Ping Jun...

388
41:53.539 --> 41:54.539
Here.

389
41:55.280 --> 41:57.240
- Bing Wen. - You're back, Bing Wen.

390
41:57.240 --> 41:58.770
- Mother. - Come quickly.

391
41:58.770 --> 42:00.270
Jin Xuan is on a lucky streak today.

392
42:00.270 --> 42:02.117
She's won several rounds already.

393
42:02.117 --> 42:04.279
Then let me get in some of that luck.

394
42:11.320 --> 42:13.059
- Mahjong. - Mahjong again!

395
42:13.059 --> 42:15.300
Look at your luck!

396
42:17.400 --> 42:20.579
Madam, the rock sugar bird's nest soup is ready.

397
42:20.579 --> 42:22.420
Here, put it down here.

398
42:27.880 --> 42:29.120
Watch out!

399
42:34.320 --> 42:36.553
Sorry! Master Bing Wen, are you all right?

400
42:37.320 --> 42:39.840
Master Bing Wen, Miss Jin Xuan, I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

401
42:39.840 --> 42:41.384
Did you get burned?

402
42:41.384 --> 42:42.680
I'm fine.

403
42:42.680 --> 42:43.986
You...

404
42:44.845 --> 42:46.800
Quick, go get the burn ointment.

405
42:46.800 --> 42:48.033
Yes, right away.

406
42:49.360 --> 42:50.760
I'll go take care of it.

407
42:59.800 --> 43:01.543
Madam, Master Chang Xuan is back.

408
43:01.543 --> 43:04.000
So what? Auntie Zhu, what are you so nervous about?

409
43:04.000 --> 43:08.833
But he's blind drunk. They had to carry him in.

410
43:09.840 --> 43:10.840
Watch his feet.

411
43:12.319 --> 43:14.223
- Madam. - How did he get like this?

412
43:14.223 --> 43:16.040
- Get a basin. - Yes.

413
43:16.040 --> 43:18.600
- And some tea to rinse his mouth. - Careful.

414
43:18.600 --> 43:20.313
Easy.

415
43:21.480 --> 43:24.345
- Hold him up. - Mom, careful.

416
43:24.345 --> 43:26.920
How did he drink this much? Where's the basin?

417
43:26.920 --> 43:28.106
Here.

418
43:32.080 --> 43:34.646
How did he get this drunk? How?

419
43:43.480 --> 43:45.306
Rinse your mouth. Come on.

420
43:48.240 --> 43:49.560
Did he swallow?

421
43:51.680 --> 43:53.360
Why is he like this?

422
43:53.360 --> 43:56.044
He hasn't drunk like this in a long time.

423
43:56.044 --> 43:57.166
Madam.

424
43:57.840 --> 43:59.543
I have no idea.

425
43:59.543 --> 44:00.866
Don't go.

426
44:03.640 --> 44:05.200
I won't let you go.

427
44:05.200 --> 44:06.972
"Don't go?"

428
44:06.972 --> 44:11.000
He's just like something out of the plays I read.

429
44:11.000 --> 44:13.480
He's definitely lovesick, drinking his sorrows away.

430
44:13.480 --> 44:16.139
Is this what you read in your room all day?

431
44:16.139 --> 44:17.199
I...

432
44:17.199 --> 44:19.199
Hush, you. Come with me.

433
44:20.800 --> 44:22.360
He had way too much.

434
44:22.360 --> 44:24.617
I'll go make him some soup to sober him up.

435
44:24.617 --> 44:25.966
Mother, me too.

436
44:40.239 --> 44:41.493
Come in.

437
44:46.600 --> 44:48.160
Is Chang Xuan all right?

438
44:48.160 --> 44:49.330
He's heavily drunk.

439
44:49.330 --> 44:50.750
Mother is looking after him.

440
44:52.400 --> 44:54.160
How's your burn?

441
44:55.720 --> 44:56.944
Is it serious?

442
44:56.944 --> 44:59.033
It's fine. Just a small burn.

443
45:00.960 --> 45:03.977
This burn ointment is better than the stuff from regular pharmacies.

444
45:03.977 --> 45:05.720
Use this.

445
45:05.720 --> 45:06.900
Jin Xuan.

446
45:07.760 --> 45:09.680
Don't worry too much about Chang Xuan.

447
45:10.280 --> 45:12.003
Something's probably weighing on him.

448
45:12.003 --> 45:14.559
I'll talk to him in a couple of days.

449
45:17.080 --> 45:20.353
Remember to apply some ointment.

450
46:02.040 --> 46:05.040
Once Ping Jun graduates, we'll hold the wedding.

451
46:05.040 --> 46:08.357
I'll send everyone an invitation and treat you all to a good drink.

452
46:08.357 --> 46:10.719
- We'll be there for sure. - Congratulations!

453
46:10.719 --> 46:13.039
May you two find your happy ending.

454
46:13.666 --> 46:15.240
[Respectfully submitted by Jiang Xue Ting]

455
46:15.240 --> 46:18.963
[Writer: Jun Guan]

456
46:24.239 --> 46:26.519
But from now on,

457
46:26.519 --> 46:29.199
let's not have any more contact.
